  "@type": "Process",
  "critical": false,
  "description": "Vulcanization of the green tire in a heated mold (press curing) under pressure (1.5-2.5 MPa) and temperature (150-180 C) for 8-20 minutes. Sulfur cross-links the rubber polymer chains, converting the plastic green stock into an elastic, dimensionally stable finished tire. Post-cure inflation, trimming, balancing, and uniformity inspection follow.",
  "early_win": false,
